 { A 'fortress' could be defined as a defensive set-up which, despite a material deficit and without much need of active defence, prevents the stronger side from making progress. We saw a few attempts at a fortress in Khalifman-Shaposhnikov, Matanovic-Larsen and Goldin-Korzubov, while the next, simple example should also help to illustrate the idea. } 1. -- 
 *

